<title>NIGERIA: Nigeria Cadbury 1996 profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigeria Cadbury 1996 profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year result for Cadbury Nigeria Plc to end-December 1996. (In million naira unless stated)</p>
<p>					  1996	 1995</p>
<p>     Turnover			8,200	6,300</p>
<p>     Profit before taxation    1,200	1,000</p>
<p>     Taxation			395.8	395.5</p>
<p>     Profit after taxation	 823	605.9</p>
<p>     Minority interest	    43.5	 26.9</p>
<p>Profit after taxation</p>
<p>	and minority interest    866.5	632.8</p>
<p>     Dividend per share (naira) 1.50	1.00</p>
<p>Closure of register May 12 to May 16, 1997.</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
